# Important Interview Point

> **PPO (Proximal Policy Optimization)**, a **Reinforcement Learning** algorithm, is used during the final training stage of models like **ChatGPT** and **Claude** through a process called **RLHF (Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback)**.
>
> This means modern **LLMs combine two Machine Learning paradigms**:
>
> - **Self-supervised Learning** → Initial large-scale pretraining on massive text datasets.
> - **Reinforcement Learning (RLHF using PPO)** → Final fine-tuning stage to align the model's behavior with human preferences and produce more helpful, safe, and accurate responses.
